        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <details class="pm-faq" open>
            <summary>💼 What collaboration and hiring models are available?</summary>
            <p>
              Zulfan is open to <strong>Full-Time Software Engineer / AI Developer</strong> roles, <strong>Project-Based Contracts</strong>, and <strong>Independent Technical Advisory</strong> — available both Remotely and Hybrid (Bandung/Jakarta).
            </p>
          </details>
          <details class="pm-faq">
            <summary>⏱️ What is the estimated project turnaround time?</summary>
            <p>
              For Edge AI and Full-Stack Web MVPs/prototypes, timelines typically range between 2–4 weeks per sprint, accompanied by regular demos, unit tests, and thorough documentation. The bag shows a rough timeline as you add sprints.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details class="pm-faq">
            <summary>🪙 Are the ₽ prices real?</summary>
            <p>
              No — Poké-Dollars are a playful way to compare the relative size of each engagement. Actual rates depend on scope and are discussed directly. Technical TMs and the CV are always free.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details class="pm-faq">
            <summary>📑 How can I download Zulfan's CV and portfolio?</summary>
            <p>
              Click <a href={cvUrl} download class="font-semibold text-blue-600 underline pm-cv-link">Download CV (PDF)</a> on the Key Items shelf, or explore his research track record in the <a href="/lab" class="font-semibold text-blue-600 underline">Research Lab</a>.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details class="pm-faq">
            <summary>⚡ What is the quickest way to reach Zulfan?</summary>
            <p>
              Check out your brief and send it to <a href={emailUrl} class="font-semibold text-blue-600 underline">{profile.person.email}</a>, or connect on <a href={linkedinUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-blue-600 underline">LinkedIn</a>.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
